 ## T-3747 — Layered close foliage and shadowed leaf light (25 November 2026)
 
+The leaf shader skips direct-light evaluation only when the incident light is exactly
+zero or the base surface faces away. Backlighting still runs for the latter; clearcoat
+keeps its independent normal evaluation. Both lighting variants, masks, shadows, sky,
+point attenuation and clearcoat match the original pixels in 64 actual WebGL cases.
+A stock local Light A–B–A timing comparison was 7,216 / 6,784 / 7,080 ms, with identical
+full-scene screenshots and unchanged geometry, resolution, samples and ceilings. Those
+local timings do not waive the retained calibrated EPYC Light failure. A current-source
+calibrated pass and all final gates remain required before the Dev merge.
+
